1)Critical missing: Reusable package (Chapter VI)
This is the biggest gap. The subject requires:

A pyproject.toml (or setup.py) to build the package
A distributable file mazegen-*.whl or mazegen-*.tar.gz at the root of the repo
The evaluator will ask you to rebuild it from source in a virtualenv
You have maze_generator.py but none of the packaging files. You need to create:

pyproject.toml      ← build configuration (name=mazegen, version, etc.)
mazegen-1.0.0-py3-none-any.whl   ← built with: pyt

